window.products.push({"id":748179,"name":"Needzo Pearlized Authentic Set of 5 Ukrainian Wooden Pysanky Pysanki Wood Easter Eggs 2 5/8 Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.88,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GnovFsGDL._AC_SL1294_.jpg","description":"PYSANKY - the Ukrainian Easter egg A Symbol of Christ’s Resurrection CHRIST IS RISEN FROM THE DEAD TRAMPLING DOWN DEATH-BY-DEATH GRANTING LIFE TO THOSE IN THE TOMBS! These colorful wood eggs have been hand painted in the Ukraine with traditional folk and religious symbols and designs. The egg is an ancient symbol of new life and rebirth spanning many religions and cultures. To the ancients the egg embodied great power to bring new life and joy. The Ukrainian people in pagan times decorated eggs to commemorate their Slavic gods and to celebrate the sun’s arrival at the coming of spring. The Christian Church adopted the egg as a symbol of Christ’s Resurrection. St. Augustine first described Christ’s Resurrection from the dead as a chick bursting from an egg. This symbolism was enhanced in the Christian East’s celebration of Pascha (Easter). At the end of the Pascha Liturgy, the faithful exchange three kisses on alternating cheeks with the greeting “Christ is Risen” to which is replied “Indeed He Is Risen.” The priest presents each with a “red” egg. At home a variety of egg dishes were prepared in different ways were served during the Easter celebration. Egg cracking games were played revealing the future until next Pascha. Egg shaped deserts were elaborately prepared. Wood eggs were suspended from hanging lamps and chandeliers. Often wood eggs would be decorated with icons and hung from the home’s vigil lights. The Ukrainian people enhanced their pre-Christian folk tradition of decorating eggs to include Christian symbolism such as the Cross. Painstakingly each egg was hand decorated with natural dyes.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GnovFsGDL._AC_SL1294_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Needzo","source_asin":"B084KJBLV1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-748179","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B084KJBLV1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B084KJBLV1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":748180,"name":"Mary Phillips Cocktail Napkins-\"People who wonder if the glass is half empty or half full miss the point. The glass is refillable.\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":5.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/512PgD21t7L._AC_.jpg","description":"The \"People who wonder if the glass is half empty or half full miss the point. The glass is refillable.\" cocktail napkin is a top choice for parties and luncheons! The classic blue and white pattern goes well with just about any decor theme. Both women and men love this witty saying. Mary Phillips cocktail napkins toss out the underlining element of fun and attitude, making yours an event they’ll not soon forget. You can also pair this little number to a bottle of wine for a most coveted hostess gift!! Each pack contains 20 5 x 5 three-ply cocktail napkins *super thick* packaged in polypropylene.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/512PgD21t7L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mary Phillips Designs","source_asin":"B088MJWKW1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-748180","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088MJWKW1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B088MJWKW1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
