window.products.push({"id":748190,"name":"Komene Mesh Office Chair-ErgoPro Ergonomic Office Chair with Lumbar Support, Adjustable headrest and 3D Armrest, High Back Mesh Computer Chair, Rollin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gfC0xHzMS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✈【HIGH BACK ERGONOMIC OFFICE CHAIR】Komene Ergonomic Office Chair adopts the most suitable ergonomic design according to the human body structure, lumbar support and adjustable headrest which creates total spinal support,the ergonomic chair provides 4 supporting points(head/ back/ hips/ hands) and a proper lumbar support. It's easy to adjust seat height, headrest, backrest and 3D Adjustable armrest to meet different needs, good for sitting long hours. Suitable for people of about 5'5\" to 6'2\". ✈【3D ARMRESTS AND ADJUSTBLE HEADREST】The large and tall backrest is comfortable for most people, the high back computer chair with it’s 3D adjustable armrests, it can forwards, back, sideways, up and down for the best fit to your body, and Lumbar System which creates total spinal support, arched seat cushion design reduces the pressure on the legs,Made with breathable Mesh adjustable headrest, up/down motion for adjustable height Can meet the needs of different scenarios. ✈【BREATHABLE MESH OFFICE CHAIR】This office chair is larger than other chairs,and it could accommodate different body build,the mesh back and mesh seat keep made of Elasto Mesh provides air circulation for extra comfy and smooth. High quality mesh resists abrasion and transformation, it makes the high back computer desk chair good for sitting for 4 ~ 8 hours, perfect for a long day sitting,It also features easy maintenance - Just wash the mesh in warm water. ✈【TILT LOCK FUNCTION AND DURABLE METAL BASE】The desk chair has the recline function makes you tilt the backrest back (90~135°) with the tilt lock or sit straight freely, adjustable back height allows the seat to go up and down for 3.94''.Our 5-Point Metal Base gives greater stability, makes this heavy-duty office chair ideal for adults up to 280lbs.the silent casters effectively protect the floor, improved safety and stability. ✈【2 YEARS AFTER-SALE SUPPORT&EASY INSTALLATION】- All office chairs come with 2 year after-sale support, so please contact us directly through your order, we will always assist you. And this computer chair with clear instruction and tools, it is easy to assemble (about 15~20 minutes). If there is any issue, please contact us and we will provide you a 100% satisfied solution.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gfC0xHzMS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Komene","source_asin":"B091MS2XMC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-748190","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B091MS2XMC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B091MS2XMC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
