window.products.push({"id":748201,"name":"Aspen & Birch - Classic Wine Glasses Set of 4 - Red Wine Glasses or White Wine Glasses, Premium Crystal Stemware, Long Stem Wine Glasses Set, Clear, 1","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.96,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pElZgPnrS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅ EXQUISITE GLASSES FOR WINE LOVERS - Overwhelm your senses with the pairing of fine wine and the classic design of these stunning glasses by Aspen & Birch. Stylish, classy, and strikingly clear - A large cylindrical bowl and long graceful stem elegantly show off a lovely rose, white, or red wine. This is not your average wine glass! A stemless wine glass changes the temperature of the wine by the heat of your hand - order a sturdy and stemmed glass, and savor your vino the way it was intended! ✅ A BEAUTIFUL GIFT FOR ALL OCCASIONS - Luxury and sophistication - Raise your glass and make a toast to the most meaningful moments in life with the PERFECT GIFT from the heart - Weddings, anniversaries, engagements, bridal showers, or just everyday casual use. A unique gift idea - Enthusiasts, romantics, and guests will surely be impressed by these glamorous glasses. Impress even more and use these glasses during holidays like Christmas, New Year's Eve, and birthday celebrations. ✅ 100% LEAD FREE PREMIUM CRYSTAL - Aspen & Birch premium glassware is made from 100% lead free ultra clear crystal glass. Brilliance and elegance of fine crystal glass stemware, meticulously crafted to enhance a decadent Burgundy, Cabernet Sauvignon, Pinot Noir, Merlot, Bordeaux, or Chardonnay. What about those \"unbreakable\" plastic acrylic, silicone, or stainless steel wine cups without stems you ask? Those are ok for the pool, but when you're wanting to INDULGE, crystal glass is FAR SUPERIOR! ✅ TRADITIONAL CRAFTSMANSHIP - These aren't the typical small, machine made, cheap, basic wine cups or bulk disposable wine goblets being produced in the quickest way possible. Molten glass is carefully shaped by hand and mouth blown by our master artisans with over 10 years experience. The thin smooth rim is designed to enhance each sip with a bouquet of aromas and create a fusion of flavors while swirling your favorite vintage - an exceptional EXPERIENCE shared with that special someone. ✅ PROTECTED PACKAGING & OUR 100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEE - Make your purchase with confidence and rest assured your gift will get to you or your loved ones in one piece - flawless condition, safe & secure, in the extra sturdy protective foam and sleek gift box packaged to prevent breakages. We take extra care hand wrapping and packing each glass in our contemporary boxes. Our no-worries, Aspen & Birch 100% Satisfaction Guarantee - Amazing glasses and amazing service will always be our standard!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pElZgPnrS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aspen & Birch","source_asin":"B085G6SS1P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-748201","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B085G6SS1P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B085G6SS1P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
