window.products.push({"id":748441,"name":"Small Christmas Tree with LED Lights, Mini Pine Trees Christmas Tree Set Christmas Decorations Star Treetop & 32 PCS Hanging Ornaments for DIY Christm","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.39,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81UgNg8PMzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✮[The Best Christmas Decoration] - The Christmas tree is indispensable for Christmas. The mini size can be placed anywhere in the house without taking up space. A mini Christmas tree with ornaments and lights creates a festive atmosphere. A joyous Christmas begins with re-decorating the Christmas tree. ✮[34 Pcs Decorations] - The Christmas tree set includes Christmas tree, pots, stars, candy canes, Santa Claus, ribbons, bows, balls, gift box ornaments and LED lights. Very nice decoration, classic Christmas style can be recycled. ✮[DIY Christmas tree] - A Christmas tree suitable for decorating with children. Stretch the Christmas tree branch, preferably tilting it up a little bit. Then hang up Christmas decorations and lights, and install AAA batteries on the lights. Tie a red Christmas skirt to the base, and then tie a ribbon to complete it. ✮[20 LED Christmas Tree] - The lights of 4 colors and three blinking modes are very beautiful. Hanging the LED string lights on the Christmas tree is very beautiful in the living room or room. ☺[Customer Satisfaction] - Providing a 100% satisfaction experience is our main priority to our customers. Feel free to message us through,if products don't meet your expectations. The celebrations start at Christmas !","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81UgNg8PMzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JUOIFIP","source_asin":"B09B722FFL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-748441","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09B722FFL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09B722FFL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":748442,"name":"Graywind Motorized Sheer Vertical Blinds Compatible with Alexa Google Smart Sheer Curtain Drapery Privacy Light Filtering Remote Control Vertical Shad","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":385.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71T2OVegbYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Unique Design: 8.27\" wide vanes (after folded in half) with unique combination of fabric slats and sheer enhances privacy and light control. It has both the light filtering of vertical blinds and the elegance of drapery, provide privacy and UV protection, additional thermal insulation and energy saving. The ideal choice for sliding-glass doors or large windows. Removable vanes, easy to clean and replaceable. No valance style. 180° Rotation Slats & Smart Track: The track length depends to your order width, more quiet and smooth, easy to install. High quality hardwired plug-in motor, just pull it and will open automatically. Free to operate manually during power-cut, no worries. Remote Control: One remote can control at most 5 blinds. The blinds connected to the same remote control can be opened or closed together or separately. The angle of slats can be adjusted by remote or mobile APP. APP Control & Voice Control: Can be controlled by mobile app (Compatible with Android & IOS) at any time, even you're away from home. Compatible with Alexa & Google Assistant, if you both choose other hardwired curtains or shades in our shop, you can create groups and voice control all of them together. (no hub required) Installation: The track can only be opened from one side, you can choose the direction from left to right or right to left by custom options. Please leave at least 1.5” width space if you install it close to the wall. After-Service: We provide a two-year limited warranty on motors, remotes and a long-term complimentary technical support. Please only order 1 curtain to test if you are not sure about size or color. Depending on the weight and distance, a return can be costly. Any after-service problems, pls email us at: service@graywindhome.com.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71T2OVegbYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Graywind","source_asin":"B09VKTSKLT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-748442","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09VKTSKLT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09VKTSKLT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
