window.products.push({"id":748448,"name":"Ascot Kettle, A05, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pDrcNBPjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Ascot symbolizes an elegant kind of lifestyle. Why Choose our glass water kettle? 2. When the water is boiled, pay attention to be careful of the lid and water vapor. When take off the metal cover, you can cover it with a cloth and carefully remove it. 3. There is a steam induction pipe inside the electric kettle, and the exit of the pipe is on the bottom of kettle, therefore if you find a small amount of water in the base, Most likely it caused by steam come out of the pipe, not because the kettle is leaking. 4. How to clean This electric kettle -what you need: an electric kettle, White vinegar(or citric acid), tap water. (1) Add White vinegar and water into the kettle, about 25% of vinegar and 75% of water. (2)Soak for 20-30 minutes. Then boil the water and discard the solution. (Rinse the kettle until the smell of vinegar is gone.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pDrcNBPjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ASCOT","source_asin":"B01N4DV70L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-748448","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N4DV70L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N4DV70L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":748449,"name":"Vremi 3 in 1 Julienne Vegetable Peeler - Citrus Fruit Peeler for Orange Lemon Cocktails - Carrot and Potato Peeler with Rotating Serrated Straight and","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71f3bvpdrIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Are you feeling like a winner today? Good! Because it’s time for the Vremi Peel of Fortune ! And the category is… fruits and vegetables. Step right up and guess which food items this peeler can handle. Hint: All of them! Peel (with zeal) every zucchini, butternut squash, potato, and citrus fruit you come across. This 3 in 1 tool comes with not one, not two, but three blades! Simply rotate the end of the peeler to choose from straight, serrated or julienne blade type. The straight blade is great for peeling or slicing standard potatoes, apples or carrots. And we love the julienne blade for garnishing cocktails with wide strips of aromatic orange or lemon rind zest. Made from durable, long lasting, rust resistant stainless steel blades, with a non-slip plastic handle and silicone rubber thumb grips for any left or right handed chef. Now you can solve the puzzle of perfect cucumber pickle chips or exquisite daikon radishes, while saving the money you’d spend on other blades to buy a vowel instead. So go ahead: Spin the peel. Product Details and Care : Size: 5 x 3 inches (13 x 8 cm) Size: 5 x 3 inches (13 x 8 cm) Features 3 Rotating Blade Types: Straight, Serrated and Julienne Features 3 Rotating Blade Types: Straight, Serrated and Julienne Stainless Steel blades, Plastic handle, Silicone finger grip Stainless Steel blades, Plastic handle, Silicone finger grip BPA Free food grade materials BPA Free food grade materials Hand washing recommended to preserve quality Hand washing recommended to preserve quality Okay to use dishwasher occasionally (top rack only) Okay to use dishwasher occasionally (top rack only) For full care instructions and safety warnings, always refer to Vremi product box and manual For full care instructions and safety warnings, always refer to Vremi product box and manual","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71f3bvpdrIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vremi","source_asin":"B01LYMUO45","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-748449","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01LYMUO45","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01LYMUO45","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
