window.products.push({"id":748480,"name":"JoyJolt Gatsby Whiskey Glass Set of 6 Textured Whiskey Glasses for Bar (10oz). Old Fashioned Rocks Glasses for Scotch, Bourbon and Liquor. Unique Whis","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Xda4yTS2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Art Deco Style for an Iconic Gift: You have a unique sense of style. The intricate details and sparkling geometric pattern of the Gatsby Whiskey Glass Set by JoyJolt bring to life the distinct art deco style of the 1920s. Vintage charm will sparkle in your display case and add eclectic personality to any party. Make It A Double Double! You love whiskey, and these large 10 oz rocks glasses let you enjoy it longer at the end of a long day. They are also large enough for cocktails so you can serve Old Fashioned, Manhattan or Whiskey Sour Cocktails in classic style at your next classy soiree. On The Rocks: At 4\" high and 3.25\" wide, these glasses are the right size for swirling to reveal the aromas - smokey or oaky, salty or malty. You’ll love the thick 1/2 inch base and 1/8 inch rim which feels solid as you sip, not flimsy. And, they fit your favorite ice cubes, spheres and whiskey stones! Extra Strength and Dishwasher Safe: Made from strong JoyJolt glass so this whiskey / bourbon glass won’t break or chip. And like all JoyJolt drinkware, it’s dishwasher-safe for easy cleaning. Unboxing Joy: The Gatsby 6 PC Rocks Glasses Set comes nestled in a sleek black box, with a magnetic close for an unboxing experience that’s as satisfying as the first sip. With a 12 Month Guarantee, they’re an effortless and beautiful gift for anyone who likes to imbibe joy.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Xda4yTS2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JoyJolt","source_asin":"B09RQ949N3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-748480","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09RQ949N3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09RQ949N3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":748481,"name":"TUO Santoku Knife - Japanese Chef Knife 7-inch High Carbon Stainless Steel - Kitchen Knives with G10 Full Tang Handle - Black Hawk-S Knives Including ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.18,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81rS9h-FwyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🔪PERFECTED SANTOKU KNIFE: The Black Hawk S 7 inch hollow ground santoku knife is designed to be elegantly modern and purposefully functional. Owning the best of kitchen knife, it offers you the versatility and flexibility in the busiest of kitchen. Featuring special-forged high-carbon stainless steel with a high-tech vacuum heat-treatment and nitrogen cryogenic tempering, it ensures you the extreme strength, flexibility, durability, and maximum performance. ✅SLEEK BLADE PATTERN: 3D pattern finish forged by the state-of-the-art technology, it is way more complicated than the traditional blade making process. It offers not only high-end appearance, but also an incredible practicality and sense of use. Since the 3D pattern reduces the contact surface between food and blade, it prevents food from sticking on the blade and provides maximized the slicing efficiency. ✅HIGH-STANDARD CRAFTSMANSHIP: Our experienced kitchen knives smiths hand sharpen the screamingly sharp edge with traditional Honbazuke method to be 8-12 degree per side.Our state-of-the-art technique and facility balance the contradictory relationship between malleability and hardness of the steel precisely. The handle is made of G10 fiberglass composite materials that feature superior lasting properties. It is nearly immune to extreme temperature or humidity. ✅ERGONOMIC DESIGN: The full-tang structure with triple rivets built-in allows even superior resilience and solid durability. The G10 handle is designed for the ergonomic grip with satisfying heft and comfort to the well-balanced chef‘s knifes. The mosaic rivet in the middle brings an overall harmony and stunning visuality to the whole piece. 💯100% SATISFACTION OR MONEY LIFTTIME SUPPOT: We promise a superior product that will give you a lifetime of exemplary service. Comes with a premium gift box, the high-value performance never look so good!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81rS9h-FwyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TUO","source_asin":"B0BM455S4Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-748481","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BM455S4Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BM455S4Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
