window.products.push({"id":748546,"name":"DOQAUS Square Ice Cube Trays - Large Ice Cube Tray for Making 12 Pcs 2.2'' Ice Cubes, Easy Release & Reusable Silicone Ice Trays with Lids for Chillin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61OtfzB1egL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[2.2” Ice Cubes & Slow-Melting] Large Square ice cube tray ​allows you to make 12 giant ice cubes each time - 2.2 inches! With this perfect size, jumbo ice cubes are very suitable for chill your drink quickly and big ice cubes melt slowly to prevent diluting drinks to keep the original taste! Perfect to chilling your Whiskey, Scotch, Bourbon, or Blended Whiskey! Stop diluting your favorite drinks & Start using DOQAUS whiskey ice cubes tray design! [Non-Stick Design & Easy to Release] Unlike the traditional silicone ice trays, these bourbon ice trays' bottom uses a combination of TPE and Silicone materials, first adopted press structure to make it easier to release ice cubes! with no need for clumsy bending or twisting without force! Remove a block of whole clear ice from the big ice cube trays silicone isn't a tough job anymore! You will find that is the best product for making big ice cubes! [Easy to Fill & Better Sealing] Simple water injection operation: direct water injection under the max water line after open the cover, no need to pass through the small funnel and fill water so carefully! Each ice trays with a removable lid for sealing, no longer worries about liquid leakage, and keeps your ice cube transparent, clean, and odor-free, dust and also allows you to stack the ice trays and save freezer space! With an ice cubes recipe by the chef for free, enjoy your ice-cool drink! [Safty & No Harmful Residue] Made of 100% food-grade silicone and PP material which are certified by LFGB and BPA free, DOQAUS large ice cube trays for cocktails with lids are safe and durable! Each ice cube compartment is separate from the others, they are odorless and reusable, with No peculiar smell of traditional silicone ice trays! No longer worry about harmful residues! Each whisky ice rock trays clean off quickly, you can simply put them into your dishwasher after use! [Creative Uses & Customer Service] Ice trays for whiskey are great for chill your whisky, also perfect for use for cocktails, wine, ice coffee, ice tea, baby food, puddings, jelly, yogurt, fruit juice, mojitos, frozen soda lemonade, freezing sauces, soup, soap! If the ice cube trays didn't work well for you, please contact us and be willing to provide a better solution for every dear customer! All your questions will be replied to within 24hrs!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61OtfzB1egL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DOQAUS","source_asin":"B098Q18898","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-748546","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B098Q18898","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B098Q18898","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
