window.products.push({"id":748672,"name":"CHUNGHOP Universal Remote for Air Conditioner Control with Back Light Big Monitor Air Conditioning Controller K-1060e 5000Code in 1 for LG, Samsung, F","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LCX32SVrL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"CHUNGHOP UNIVERSAL AIR CONDITIONER REMOTE CONTROL With 5000 Codes in chip, can be matched with 99% Brands of air conditioner. This remote needs pairing, but it's easy to complete the pairing, just need to read the instruction clearly. Function: Celsius / Fahrenheit Degree Switch Function \"C/F\"- Press \"C/F\" button to switch between \"Celsius\" and \"Fahrenheit\". Celsius / Fahrenheit Degree Switch Function \"C/F\" - Press \"C/F\" button to switch between \"Celsius\" and \"Fahrenheit\". Timer On/OffThis function can be effective only when the original remote control has timer function. After pressing \"TIME ON\" or \"TIME OFF\" buttons, the timer indicator is displayed, and the A/C is now in the timer state. Timer On/Off This function can be effective only when the original remote control has timer function. After pressing \"TIME ON\" or \"TIME OFF\" buttons, the timer indicator is displayed, and the A/C is now in the timer state. Child LockLock: Press \"SET\" and \"Manual wind direction\" (bottom left) buttons at the same time, the lock icon will appear on the display screen.Unlock: Press \"SET\" and \"Manual wind direction\" (bottom left) buttons at the same time, the lock icon will disappear on the display screen. Child Lock Lock: Press \"SET\" and \"Manual wind direction\" (bottom left) buttons at the same time, the lock icon will appear on the display screen.Unlock: Press \"SET\" and \"Manual wind direction\" (bottom left) buttons at the same time, the lock icon will disappear on the display screen. Battery Replacement MemoryThe remote control's chip has a built-in memory  function, ensuring that there is no need to reset for a short-term power off like battery replacement etc. Battery Replacement Memory The remote control's chip has a built-in memory  function, ensuring that there is no need to reset for a short-term power off like battery replacement etc. BacklightThe backlight covers the whole panel. Pressing any button to light it, and it will switch off after 10 seconds if there is no operation. Backlight The backlight covers the whole panel. Pressing any button to light it, and it will switch off after 10 seconds if there is no operation. LED FlashlightPress&hold the \"Light\" button to switch on the LED light, release it to switch if off. LED Flashlight Press&hold the \"Light\" button to switch on the LED light, release it to switch if off. NOTE: This remote is without battery, and please read off the compatible brands list before you purchase our remote,  thank you!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LCX32SVrL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CHUNGHOP","source_asin":"B08794RW8X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-748672","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08794RW8X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08794RW8X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
