window.products.push({"id":748812,"name":"Bodum Assam Double Wall Shot/Espresso Glass, 9 centiliters","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.89,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZwznYrtDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description The Bodum Double Wall Assam Shot/Espresso Glasses are 3 ounces in size and can be used for cold or warm beverages. Its unique design is appealing to the eye when filled with your favorite beverage. With its double layer of borosilicate glass it appears as though the liquid is 'floating' within the glass. This size also works nicely for sake and green tea. The double wall creates a thermal effect, helping to keep your cold drinks cold and your hot drinks hot for longer periods of time. These mouth blown glasses are an exciting product for any home, restaurant, and cafe and are a definite conversation piece. The double wall also makes for a nice votive candle holder, eliminating wax spills and the need for a coaster. Amazon.com What's not to love? These handsome glasses combine great looks with insulating temperature control qualities and anti-condensation protection to boot. Keep your espresso piping hot in the morning and your sake cool in the evening with this set of two shot/espresso glasses, each 3 inches tall and holding 3 ounces of your favorite beverages. These glasses, like all Bodum Assam glasses, are hand made and mouth blown, and cleverly feature a two glass walls, trapping air between the walls to provide insulation, keeping hot drinks hot and cold drinks cold. As an added bonus, the dual layers prevent condensation accumulating on the outside of cold drinks and dripping onto your wood tables. The design is not only functional but adds a striking visual aspect to the containers also: beverages seem to float within the glass due to the double-walled design. Taller than they are wide and featuring a wider top than bottom, the visual appeal is further enhanced because the inner layer has a more tapered profile than the exterior. Made of borosilicate glass, the set is dishwasher safe. The design has won several awards and rave reviews, notably the European iF Design Award. Match with any Bodum Assam glassware, or coordinate with Bodum's other double-walled insulated glassware patterns, Pavina and Canteen. --Jeff Dalto","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZwznYrtDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bodum","source_asin":"B09KH8HJBZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-748812","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09KH8HJBZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09KH8HJBZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":748813,"name":"Spiderman & Marvel Superhero Canvas Wall Art Decor Print | 12x24 Avengers Super Hero Inspirational Quote Poster & Artwork for Bedroom & Nursery Walls","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91mvL-eqlAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This wall decoration is the perfect gift to add something new and refreshing to your home! Our line of art suits everyone of all ages, ethnicity and gender, so that you can find yourself the perfect aesthetic! It arrives pre-assembled in a wooden frame and can be quickly hung up on any wall. We use high-definition digital printing methods, top quality materials, hand frame every piece, and ship in a premium protective shipping package.We sell licensed material for Marvel, DC Comics, Disney, Star Wars, and much more to offer you the greatest selections of artwork ranging across all styles and genres. Pop Creations is known for its quality artwork printing and materials, and we are fully committed to maintaining this reputation! If for any reason the product does not meet your expectations contact us, and we'll make it right! We are not satisfied until you are.Our extensive product line includes LED canvas wall art, framed 3D art, superhero inspirational art, foam decals, wood art, collages, neon signs, framed MDF prints, embellished canvas, among others.We invite you to try and experience for yourself the amazing selection and quality of art work from POP Creations!Choose motivational and inspirational images from Comic Book Superheroes to Disney Princesses, and revive your house decor setup. We have art work for men and women and children, framed or unframed, perfect for any home, college dorm, kid room, man cave, den, bathroom, kitchen or farmhouse walls.ESPANOL:Este decoracion para el hogar es muy fantastico y estos cuadros de pared de sala se ven una decoration muy bien para todos cuartos. Puedes usar los adornos para dormitorios, la cocina, o el hogar.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91mvL-eqlAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"POP Creations","source_asin":"B06XTQVTYP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-748813","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XTQVTYP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XTQVTYP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
