window.products.push({"id":748938,"name":"Tuhome Austral 3 Door Armoire with Drawers, Shelves, and Hanging Rod, Black Wenge","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":387.09,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31r3zQ6qTqL._AC_.jpg","description":"The Austral Collection Armoire is the perfect addition to any room in your home. This spacious armoire has three different storage options. The double door cabinet provides ample space for clothing, and contains a covered hanging rail. The full-height cabinet on the right contains four tall shelves, with varying heights to accommodate any storage need. All four shelves are 10.9\" wide, with heights of 13.6\", 15.7\", 15.7\", and 19.5\". Two wider storage drawers offer further versatility. Available in a variety of attractive finishes, you're sure to find the perfect fit for any room. Features Amazing addition of space and storage for your room Amazing addition of space and storage for your room 5 spacious shelves for clothing and accessories 5 spacious shelves for clothing and accessories Includes 2 drawers for additional space Includes 2 drawers for additional space Featuring a hanging rod Featuring a hanging rod Covered by a one year warranty Covered by a one year warranty Decor and setting objects are not included Decor and setting objects are not included Complete your room with other items from the collection (sold separately) Complete your room with other items from the collection (sold separately) TSCA compliant, FSC certified, and CPSIA compliant TSCA compliant, FSC certified, and CPSIA compliant TUHOME Furniture Collections are inspired by the versatility of every day. Purpose and functionality are the key motives during the design process. Our sleek and contemporary designs are not only beautiful, but also maximize your living space. We love what we do and express it through our high quality, stylish furniture products. Our focus is on offering unique products, providing a perfect combination between competitive prices, excellent quality and functional and innovative designs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31r3zQ6qTqL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tuhome","source_asin":"B07V3XJ5CC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-748938","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07V3XJ5CC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07V3XJ5CC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
